      "message": "Given that you\u0027re looking for an advice, can we add report DICE error with IVirtualMachineCallback? If it\u0027s possible, then it would be a reliable way for getting DICE error.\n\nIf it\u0027s not possible, consider followings:\n  - Option 1) Do not rely on logcat, but only check whether it boots or not. Incomplete check, but test result would be more reliable.\n  - Option 2) Add `@FlakyTest` with sufficient tolerance, and increase timeout.\n\nIf you want to be super-neat, then you can pick both options by adding two tests -- one with `@FlakyTest` and one without logcat check. But up to you.",
